# Mirrors the sibling caldav_tasks_api repo, with one deliberate difference:
# the sibling uses a blanket `.env*` which would also swallow `.env.example`,
# so the example file is explicitly un-ignored below.
.aider*
**/__pycache__
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.egg-info
.venv/
dist/
build/
.pytest_cache/
docs/build/
